#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:14
msgid "Open CSV"
msgstr "Odpri CSV"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:14
msgid "Open XML"
msgstr "Odpri XML"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:22
#: includes/class-admin.php:287
msgid "Public price list"
msgstr "Javni cenik"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:27
msgid "The webshop has its own public price list (XML or CSV) and a 30-day archive. Each outlet has a separate file: the Woo products you add to it, plus manual rows (services, shipping) with its label. A daily cron after 00:00 regenerates the webshop and the outlets. The outlet type, address, label and storage number are entered on the Outlets tab."
msgstr "Spletna trgovina ima lasten javni cenik (XML ali CSV) in 30-dnevni arhiv. Vsaka poslovalnica ima ločeno datoteko: Woo izdelke, ki jih ji dodate, plus ročne vrstice (storitve, dostava) s to oznako. Dnevni cron po 00:00 regenerira spletno trgovino in poslovalnice. Obliko, naslov, oznako in številko hrambe vnesete na zavihku Poslovalnice."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:28
msgid "The price list of published products and variations is public at a fixed address (XML or CSV). A daily cron after 00:00 regenerates the file and stores it in a 30-day archive under the official name, so it is available before 08:00. The outlet type, address, label and storage number of the webshop are entered on the Outlets tab. Barcode (GTIN/UPC/EAN/ISBN) and availability (dostupno/nedostupno, from stock) are always exported with the prices."
msgstr "Cenik objavljenih izdelkov in variacij je javno na voljo na fiksni naslov (XML ali CSV). Dnevni cron po 00:00 regenerira datoteko in jo shrani v 30-dnevni arhiv pod uradnim imenom, da je na voljo pred 08:00. Obliko, naslov, oznako in številko hrambe spletne trgovine vnesete na zavihku Poslovalnice. Ob cenah se vedno izvozita barkod (GTIN/UPC/EAN/ISBN) in na voljo/ni na voljo glede na zalogo."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:37
#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:32
#: includes/admin/tab-proizvodi.php:82
#: includes/admin/tab-uvoz-izvoz.php:115
#: includes/class-admin.php:823
msgid "Webshop"
msgstr "Webshop"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:37
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Naslov"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:48
msgid "HTML price list"
msgstr "HTML cenik"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:51
msgid "Open price list"
msgstr "Odpri cenik"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:58
#: includes/class-feed-routes.php:778
msgid "Archive"
msgstr "Arhiv"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:61
msgid "Open archive"
msgstr "Odpri arhiv"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:86
#. translators: 1: datetime, 2: product count
#, php-format
msgid "Last generation: %1$s (%2$d products/variations)."
msgstr "Zadnje generiranje: %1$s (%2$d izdelkov/variacij)."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:94
msgid "The file has not been generated yet. Click the button or open the public URL—the price list will then be created."
msgstr "Datoteka še ni generirana. Kliknite gumb ali odprite javni naslov – cenik se bo nato ustvaril."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:100
msgid "Export format"
msgstr "Format izvoza"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:114
msgid "Changes only the current public link and new generations. Files in the archive remain in the format they were created in."
msgstr "Spremeni le trenutno javno povezavo in nova generiranja. Datoteke v arhivu ostanejo v formatu, v katerem so nastale."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:118
msgid "The outlet type, address, label and storage number for the webshop and additional outlets are entered on the Outlets tab."
msgstr "Obliko, naslov, oznako in številko hrambe za spletno trgovino in dodatne poslovalnice vnesete na zavihku Poslovalnice."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:121
msgid "Open the Outlets tab."
msgstr "Odpri zavihek Poslovalnice."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:130
msgid "Regenerate public price list daily after 00:00"
msgstr "Regeneriraj javni cenik dnevno po 00:00"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:136
msgid "Daily generation at 00:05 depends on WordPress cron. It runs only on the next request that loads PHP, so on a low-traffic store or behind full-page cache the feed may be delayed after 08:00. In wp-config.php set DISABLE_WP_CRON to true and from system cron call wp-cron.php every 5 to 15 minutes."
msgstr "Dnevno generiranje ob 00:05 je odvisno od WordPress cron-a. Zažene se šele ob naslednji zahtevi, ki naloži PHP, zato lahko na trgovini z malo prometa ali za cacheom celotne strani feed zamudi po 08:00. V wp-config.php nastavite DISABLE_WP_CRON na true in iz sistemskega cron-a vsakih 5 do 15 minut pokličite wp-cron.php."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:151
#. translators: %s: datetime
#, php-format
msgid "Last successful generation (%s) is more than 26 hours old. The public price list may not be ready before 08:00."
msgstr "Zadnje uspešno generiranje (%s) je starejše od 26 ur. Javni cenik morda ne bo pripravljen pred 08:00."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:156
msgid "The public price list has not been generated yet. Until the file exists, the HTML page and shortcode show that the price list is being prepared."
msgstr "Javni cenik še ni generiran. Dok datoteka ne obstaja, HTML stran in shortcode prikažeta, da se cenik pripravlja."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:167
#. translators: %s: datetime
#, php-format
msgid "Last successful generation: %s."
msgstr "Zadnje uspešno generiranje: %s."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:176
msgid "Enabled by default. After 00:05 (WordPress timezone) the public price list is regenerated so it is available before the legal deadline of 08:00, and stored in the archive under the official name (max 30 files)."
msgstr "Privzeto vključeno. Po 00:05 (časovni pas WordPressa) se regenerira javni cenik, da je na voljo pred zakonskim rokom 08:00, in se shrani v arhiv pod uradnim imenom (največ 30 datotek)."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:179
msgid "DISABLE_WP_CRON is enabled, so system cron at 00:05 calls wp-cron.php."
msgstr "DISABLE_WP_CRON je vključen, zato ob 00:05 sistemski cron kliče wp-cron.php."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:181
msgid "WordPress cron runs that job only on the next PHP request."
msgstr "WordPress cron to opravilo zažene šele ob naslednji PHP zahtevi."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:191
#. translators: %s: datetime
#, php-format
msgid "Next automatic generation: %s."
msgstr "Naslednje samodejno generiranje: %s."

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:201
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Shrani"

#: includes/admin/tab-javni-xml.php:205
msgid "Generate public price list"
msgstr "Generiraj javni cenik"

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:22
msgid "The webshop is the default outlet: its type, address, label and storage number go into the official file name (NN 101/2026). Add more outlets below. Each one gets its own public XML or CSV and a 30-day archive. Assign manual items (services, shipping) on the first tab by choosing an outlet above the table. Deleting an outlet also deletes those items."
msgstr "Spletna trgovina je privzeta poslovalnica: oblika, naslov, oznaka in številka hrambe vstopijo v uradno ime datoteke (UL 101/2026). Dodatne poslovalnice dodajte spodaj. Vsaka dobi lasten javni XML ali CSV in 30-dnevni arhiv. Ročne postavke (storitve, dostava) dodelite na prvem zavihku z izbiro poslovalnice nad tabelo. Brisanje poslovalnice izbriše tudi te postavke."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:33
msgid "Webshop public price list: /sidrena-cijena.xml (or .csv). All published products and manual rows without an outlet label."
msgstr "Javni cenik spletne trgovine: /sidrena-cijena.xml (ali .csv). Vsi objavljeni izdelki in ročne vrstice brez oznake poslovalnice."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:39
#: includes/class-admin.php:827
msgid "Outlet type"
msgstr "Oblika prodajnega objekta"

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:41
msgid "Written exactly as it should appear, e.g. webshop or prodavaonica."
msgstr "Kakor je napisano, npr. spletna trgovina ali prodajalna."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:44
#: includes/class-admin.php:829
msgid "Outlet address"
msgstr "Naslov prodajnega objekta"

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:46
#: includes/class-admin.php:830
msgid "Street and city remain in the name, e.g. Ilica 150 Zagreb."
msgstr "Ulica in kraj ostane v imenu, npr. Ilica 150 Zagreb."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:49
#: includes/class-admin.php:831
msgid "Outlet label"
msgstr "Oznaka prodajnega objekta"

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:51
msgid "Internal label, e.g. WEB or 001. The hyphen is kept."
msgstr "Notranja oznaka, npr. WEB ali 001. Pomišljaj ostane."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:54
#: includes/class-admin.php:833
msgid "Next storage number"
msgstr "Naslednja številka hrambe"

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:56
#: includes/class-admin.php:834
msgid "Increases once per day. Regenerating on the same day does not increase the number. The name uses what you enter, e.g. 104."
msgstr "Raste enkrat na dan. Ponovno generiranje istega dne ne poveča števila. V ime gre, kakor je vpisano, npr. 104."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:64
#. translators: %s: example filename
#, php-format
msgid "Next official name: %s (Ministry example: prodavaonica_Ilica 150 Zagreb_P-01_104_01.10.2026_07:45). On a Windows server the time uses a hyphen, 07-45."
msgstr "Naslednje uradno ime: %s (primer ministrstva: prodavaonica_Ilica 150 Zagreb_P-01_104_01.10.2026_07:45). Na strežniku Windows gre čas s pomišljajem, 07-45."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:73
msgid "Additional outlets"
msgstr "Dodatne poslovalnice"

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:76
msgid "Add outlet"
msgstr "Dodaj poslovalnico"

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:79
msgid "Each outlet gets the URL /sidrena-cijena-LABEL.xml (or .csv) and its own archive of 30 files."
msgstr "Vsaka poslovalnica dobi naslov /sidrena-cijena-OZNAKA.xml (ali .csv) in lasten arhiv 30 datotek."

#: includes/admin/tab-poslovnice.php:85
msgid "Save outlets"
msgstr "Shrani poslovalnice"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:18
msgid "The bazna cijena is shown next to the current price (in the Government decisions: dodatna or sidrena cijena), clearly and separately from the price the customer pays. The default label is Bazna cijena. The plugin can show it automatically below the price, or only through the shortcode [sidrena-cijena]."
msgstr "Ob aktualni ceni se izpostavi bazna cena (v odločbah Vlade: dodatna ali sidrna cena), jasno in ločeno od cene, ki jo kupec plača. Privzeti napis je Bazna cena. Vtičnik jo lahko prikaže samodejno pod ceno ali le prek shortcode-a [sidrena-cijena]."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:19
msgid "The bazna cijena is shown next to the current price (in the Government decisions: dodatna or sidrena cijena). The default label is Bazna cijena. Enter items on the Products tab; the public HTML page is /sidrena-cjenik, and the XML/CSV feed stays at /sidrena-cijena.xml or .csv."
msgstr "Ob aktualni ceni se izpostavi bazna cena (v odločbah Vlade: dodatna ali sidrna cena). Privzeti napis je Bazna cena. Vnesite postavke na zavihku Izdelki; javna HTML stran je /sidrena-cjenik, XML/CSV feed pa ostane na /sidrena-cijena.xml ali .csv."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:32
#. translators: %s detected 30-day lowest price plugin name
#, php-format
msgid "%s was detected. This plugin works with it: one sidrena cijena row, between the current price and the “Lowest price in the last 30 days” row."
msgstr "Zaznan je %s. Sidrna cena deluje z njim: ena vrstica sidrne cene med aktualno ceno in vrstico „Najnižja cena v zadnjih 30 dneh“."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:43
msgid "Storefront display"
msgstr "Prikaz v trgovini"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:44
msgid "Text, date, and how it is highlighted next to the product price."
msgstr "Besedilo, datum in način izpostavitve ob ceni izdelka."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:54
#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:61
msgid "Automatic display of sidrena cijena"
msgstr "Samodejni prikaz sidrnih cen"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:64
msgid "The plugin automatically shows the sidrena cijena below the current price. If this is off, use the shortcode [sidrena-cijena] or [sidrena-cijena id=\"x\"] to show it outside product loops. For a single amount add prikaz=\"redovna\", prikaz=\"akcijska\" or prikaz=\"sidrena\"."
msgstr "Vtičnik samodejno prikaže sidrne cene pod aktualnimi cenami. Če je izključeno, uporabite shortcode [sidrena-cijena] ali [sidrena-cijena id=\"x\"] za prikaz zunaj zank. Za samo en znesek dodajte prikaz=\"redovna\", prikaz=\"akcijska\" ali prikaz=\"sidrena\"."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:68
msgid "Automatic fill for new products"
msgstr "Samodejno polnjenje novih izdelkov"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:75
msgid "Fill an empty sidrena cijena and date on save"
msgstr "Ob shranjevanju zapolni prazno sidrno ceno in datum"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:78
msgid "For products and variations added after the plugin was activated. If the fields are empty, the current regular price and today's date are entered (WordPress timezone). A sidrena cijena and date that are already entered are not overwritten."
msgstr "Za izdelke in variacije, dodane po aktivaciji vtičnika. Če so polja prazna, se zapiše trenutna redna cena in današnji datum (časovni pas WordPressa). Že vneseni sidrni ceni in datuma se ne prepišejo."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:83
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "Predpona"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:87
msgid "Words only, no date. Preview:"
msgstr "Samo besede, brez datuma. Predogled:"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:93
msgid "Date format"
msgstr "Format datuma"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:98
msgid "Prefix (date)"
msgstr "Predpona (datum)"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:102
msgid "Prefix date"
msgstr "Predpona datum"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:105
msgid "Examples: Bazna cijena (10.09.2026.) or Bazna cijena 10.09.2026. If the prefix ends with “na”, you get Bazna cijena na 10.09.2026. You can also enter Sidrena cijena. An empty prefix with “Prefix date” shows only the date and the amount."
msgstr "Primeri: Bazna cena (10.09.2026.) ali Bazna cena 10.09.2026. Če predpona konča z „na“, dobite Bazna cena na 10.09.2026. Lahko vpišete tudi Sidrna cena. Prazna predpona z „Predpona datum“ izpiše le datum in znesek."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:109
msgid "Default reference date"
msgstr "Privzeti referenčni datum"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:112
msgid "Used in the selected format on the storefront. For FMCG (food, beverages, cosmetics…) enter 02.05.2025 on the product."
msgstr "Uporabi se v izbranem formatu na vitrini. Za FMCG (hrana, pijača, kozmetika …) pri izdelku vpišite 02.05.2025."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:116
msgid "Tooltip"
msgstr "Tooltip"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:123
msgid "Show tooltip on storefront"
msgstr "Prikaži tooltip na vitrini"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:126
msgid "On mouse hover over the sidrena cijena."
msgstr "Ob prehodu miške čez sidrno ceno."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:130
msgid "Tooltip text"
msgstr "Besedilo tooltipa"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:133
msgid "Shown on mouse hover over the sidrena cijena."
msgstr "Prikaže se ob prehodu miške čez sidrno ceno."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:137
msgid "Unit price (CJM)"
msgstr "Cena na enoto mere (CJM)"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:144
msgid "Enable unit of measure next to the sidrena cijena"
msgstr "Omogoči mersko enoto ob sidrni ceni"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:147
msgid "When this is on, the unit price (CJM) appears next to the sidrena cijena: on the Woo product and variation, and on every row of the Products or Additional items tab. Turn it on for the row and enter a suffix (e.g. \"za kg/l\"), and the shop shows \"Cijena za kg/l (10.09.2026.)\". The same unit of measure goes into the public XML/CSV and the HTML table."
msgstr "Ko je vključeno, ob sidrni ceni se prikaže CJM: na Woo izdelku in variaciji ter v vsaki vrstici zavihka Izdelki ali Dodatne postavke. Vključite ga v vrstici in vpišite nadaljevanje (npr. \"za kg/l\"), nato se prikaže \"Cena za kg/l (10.09.2026.)\". Ista merska enota gre v javni XML/CSV in v HTML tabelo."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:151
#: includes/admin/tab-proizvodi.php:105
#: includes/admin/tab-uvoz-izvoz.php:84
#: includes/class-feed-files.php:891
msgid "Brand"
msgstr "Znamka"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:155
msgid "No taxonomy"
msgstr "Brez taksonomije"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:160
msgid "For WooCommerce products, the brand in the price list is the name of the term from the selected taxonomy (e.g. product_brand or pa_marka). A variation without a term takes the parent's brand."
msgstr "Za WooCommerce izdelke je znamka v ceniku ime pojma iz izbrane taksonomije (npr. product_brand ali pa_marka). Variacija brez pojma prevzame znamko starša."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:163
msgid "Manual brand"
msgstr "Ročna znamka"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:166
msgid "Used when the product has no term in the taxonomy, and when the Brand field on a manual row is empty. Manual rows (Products or Additional items) have their own field."
msgstr "Uporabi se, ko izdelek nima pojma v taksonomiji in ko je polje Znamka v ročni vrstici prazno. Ročne vrstice (Izdelki ali Dodatne postavke) imajo lastno polje."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:171
msgid "Public price list (XML/CSV)"
msgstr "Javni cenik (XML/CSV)"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:173
msgid "Availability (dostupno/nedostupno) and barcode are always exported. On the webshop, availability follows the WooCommerce stock status. On other outlets, availability is the one imported for that outlet, not the webshop stock. The barcode is read from the GTIN, UPC, EAN or ISBN field. If the product has no barcode, the field stays empty."
msgstr "Na voljo/ni na voljo in barkod se vedno izvozita. Na spletni trgovini razpoložljivost sledi stanju zaloge WooCommerce. Na drugih poslovalnicah je razpoložljivost tista, uvožena v to poslovalnico, ne zaloga spletne trgovine. Barkod se prebere iz polj GTIN, UPC, EAN ali ISBN. Če izdelek nima barkoda, polje ostane prazno."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:179
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Shrani nastavitve"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:186
msgid "Filling empty fields"
msgstr "Polnjenje praznih polj"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:187
msgid "Only empty fields are filled with the current regular price. A sidrena cijena that is already entered is never overwritten. New products can be filled automatically on save if this is on in the settings."
msgstr "Le prazna polja se napolnijo s trenutno redno ceno. Že vnesene sidrne cene se nikoli ne prepišejo. Nove izdelke lahko ob shranjevanju samodejno napolnite, če je to vključeno v nastavitvah."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:192
msgid "Fill empty fields from regular price"
msgstr "Zapolni prazna polja iz redne cene"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:196
msgid "For products that were in the assortment on the default reference day. The date stays the default from settings (e.g. 10.09.2026.)."
msgstr "Za izdelke, ki so bili v asortimentu na privzeti referenčni dan. Datum ostane privzeti iz nastavitev (npr. 10.09.2026.)."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:201
msgid "Fill empty sidrena cijena fields with today's date"
msgstr "Zapolni prazne sidrne cene z današnjim datumom"

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:205
msgid "For products put on sale after the reference day. Enters the regular price and today's date (WordPress timezone). An existing date on the product is not overwritten."
msgstr "Za izdelke, postavljene v prodajo po referenčnem dnevu. Zapiše redno ceno in današnji datum (časovni pas WordPressa). Obstoječi datum pri izdelku se ne prepiše."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:214
msgid "Filling runs in short steps with a progress bar. If the server stops the request, the plugin continues on its own. A sidrena cijena that is already entered is not overwritten, so you can press the button again for the remaining items. You can also enter a single price and date by hand on the product, below the sale price."
msgstr "Polnjenje poteka v kratkih korakih s trakom napredka. Če strežnik prekine zahtevo, vtičnik nadaljuje sam. Že vnesene sidrne cene se ne prepišejo, gumb pa lahko ponovno pritisnete za preostale artikle. Posamezno ceno in datum lahko ročno vpišete tudi pri izdelku, pod akcijsko ceno."

#: includes/admin/tab-postavke.php:217
msgid "For large catalogs use WP-CLI (much faster than this button): wp cx-sidrena fill --dry-run then wp cx-sidrena fill. New products: wp cx-sidrena fill --today"
msgstr "Za velike kataloge uporabite WP-CLI (precej hitreje od tega gumba): wp cx-sidrena fill --dry-run  nato  wp cx-sidrena fill. Novi izdelki: wp cx-sidrena fill --today"

#: includes/admin/tab-proizvodi.php:31
msgid "Services and products that are not in WooCommerce (e.g. made to order, or a shipping class). Name, regular price and sidrena cijena are required. The type sets the columns of the public price list. Leave the date empty for the default reference day, or enter the day the item was first listed. If you have several outlets, choose the webshop or an outlet above the table - the rows go only into that price list. Availability is a dropdown: in stock or out of stock. The shortcode [sidrena-cijena id=\"dX\"] shows the prices of that row on a page. For a single amount add prikaz=\"redovna\", prikaz=\"akcijska\" or prikaz=\"sidrena\"."
msgstr "Storitve in izdelki, ki niso v WooCommerce (npr. po naročilu ali razred dostave). Ime, redna cena in sidrna cena so obvezni. Vrsta določi stolpce javnega cenika. Datum pustite prazen za privzeti referenčni dan ali vpišite dan prve uvrstitve. Če imate več poslovalnic, nad tabelo izberite spletno trgovino ali poslovalnico – vrstice gredo le v ta cenik. Razpoložljivost je spustni seznam: na voljo ali ni na voljo. Shortcode [sidrena-cijena id=\"dX\"] prikaže cene te vrstice na strani. Za samo en znesek dodajte prikaz=\"redovna\", prikaz=\"akcijska\" ali prikaz=\"sidrena\"."

#: includes/admin/tab-proizvodi.php:32
msgid "Each row becomes an item of the public price list (XML/CSV and HTML). Name, regular price and sidrena cijena are required. The type sets the columns: product or service. Leave the date empty for the default reference day, or enter the day the item was first listed. If you have several outlets, choose the webshop or an outlet above the table. Availability is a dropdown: in stock or out of stock. Empty rows are not saved. The shortcode [sidrena-cijena id=\"x\"] shows the prices of this row on any page. For a single amount add prikaz=\"redovna\", prikaz=\"akcijska\" or prikaz=\"sidrena\". Insert the whole table with the shortcode [sidrena-cjenik]."
msgstr "Vsaka vrstica postane postavka javnega cenika (XML/CSV in HTML). Ime, redna cena in sidrna cena so obvezni. Vrsta določi stolpce: izdelek ali storitev. Datum pustite prazen za privzeti referenčni dan ali vpišite dan prve uvrstitve. Če imate več poslovalnic, nad tabelo izberite spletno trgovino ali poslovalnico. Razpoložljivost je spustni seznam: na voljo ali ni na voljo. Prazne vrstice se ne shranijo. Shortcode [sidrena-cijena id=\"x\"] na kateri koli strani prikaže cene iz te vrstice. Za samo en znesek dodajte prikaz=\"redovna\", prikaz=\"akcijska\" ali prikaz=\"sidrena\". Celotno tabelo vstavite s shortcode-om [sidrena-cjenik]."

