#: includes/class-product-fields.php:52
msgid "Regular retail price on the reference day (2 May 2025 for FMCG, 10 September 2026 for everything else). Enter it in the same format as the regular price (with or without VAT, per WooCommerce tax settings). Do not enter the sale price."
msgstr "Redna maloprodajna cena na referenčni dan (2. 5. 2025 za FMCG, 10. 9. 2026 za ostalo). Vnesite jo v isti obliki kot redno ceno (z ali brez DDV, glede na nastavitev davka WooCommerce). Ne vnašajte akcijske cene."

